---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Niwot, Colorado
seoTitle: Niwot, Colorado Community Guide | TownofNiwot.com
description: An independent guide to Niwot, Colorado — what to see, where to eat, what is on, who runs what, and neutral information on the 2026 incorporation election.
navKey: home
bodyClass: n-home
permalink: /
needsEvents: true
scripts:
  - /assets/js/page-home.js
  - /assets/js/forms.js
structuredData:
  "@context": https://schema.org
  "@type": WebSite
  name: TownofNiwot.com
  url: https://townofniwot.com
  description: An independent community guide to Niwot, Colorado.
  publisher:
    "@type": Organization
    name: TownofNiwot.com
    description: An independent community guide. Not a municipal government website.
pageStyles: |
  .n-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,.72fr);gap:clamp(24px,3vw,56px);align-items:start}
  .n-hero-mark{font-size:clamp(3.5rem,11vw,9rem)}
  /* The hero photo sits inside the gutter, aligned to the same right edge as
     the nav and the body copy. The design handoff called for it to bleed off
     the screen edge; the client asked for it contained. */
  .n-quick{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:0 clamp(20px,3vw,52px)}
  .n-exp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(18px,2vw,34px)}
  .n-exp-wide{grid-column:span 2}
  @media (max-width:900px){.n-hero{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.n-quick{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr)}.n-exp{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.n-exp-wide{grid-column:span 1}}
  @media (max-width:560px){.n-quick{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.n-hero-mark{font-size:clamp(3.25rem,18vw,4.75rem)}}
quick:
  - label: Events Calendar
    note: Month by month, with organizer links
    href: /events/
  - label: Business Directory
    note: Eat, shop and local services
    href: /eat-shop/
  - label: Parks & Trails
    note: Whistle Stop Park and the LoBo trail
    href: /explore/#outdoors
  - label: Community Organizations
    note: Groups to join and who runs what
    href: /community/
  - label: Resident Resources
    note: County services, water, sewer, fire, schools
    href: /community/#resources
  - label: 2026 Incorporation Election
    note: Ballot questions and official resources
    href: /civic/incorporation-election/
resources:
  - what: Building permits and land use
    who: Boulder County
    href: https://bouldercounty.gov/property-and-land/land-use/planning/
  - what: Drinking water
    who: Left Hand Water District
    href: https://lefthandwater.org/
  - what: Fire and rescue
    who: Mountain View Fire Rescue
    href: https://www.mvfpd.org/
  - what: Schools
    who: St. Vrain Valley Schools
    href: https://www.svvsd.org/
facts:
  - label: The caboose
    text: CB&Q 14649, a Burlington Route caboose built in 1907, stands on a short length of track at Whistle Stop Park, at the edge of Old Town.
  - label: The grid
    text: The street plan follows the 1875 town plat, laid out along the railroad rather than the county road grid that came later.
  - label: The edge
    text: Farmland begins immediately east of the storefronts. The walk from brick to open field takes about four minutes.
---
{#- 1. Hero: the wordmark, a one-line promise, a short introduction and two
    actions. Everything else people come for is in the quick links below. -#}
<section class="n-bg-white n-home-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-h">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-top:clamp(24px,3.5vw,52px)">
<div class="n-hero">
<div style="padding-bottom:clamp(10px,1.5vw,24px)">
<h1 class="n-display n-hero-mark" id="hero-h" style="color:var(--n-evergreen)">NIWOT</h1>
<p class="n-lead" style="margin:clamp(14px,1.8vw,22px) 0 0;font-family:var(--n-serif);font-size:clamp(1.25rem,1.05rem + .7vw,1.75rem);line-height:1.25;color:var(--n-evergreen)">A small place worth knowing.</p>
<div class="n-rail" style="margin-top:clamp(14px,2vw,22px)"></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 22px;margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--n-muted)">
<span>Boulder County, Colorado</span><span>Pop. 4,306 &#8212; 2020 census</span><span>Walkable in an afternoon</span>
</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:clamp(16px,2vw,24px) 0 0;max-width:52ch">Two blocks of brick storefronts, a red caboose in the park, and open fields where the sidewalks stop. Park once on Second Avenue for lunch on a patio and the shops and galleries, then follow the trail out toward the Front Range.</p>
<div class="n-btns" style="margin-top:clamp(18px,2.4vw,30px)">
<a class="n-btn" href="/plan-a-visit/">Plan a Visit</a>
<a class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" href="/eat-shop/">Find local businesses</a>
</div>
</div>
<figure style="margin:0">
{% photo "second-avenue-patios.jpg", "Buildings on the 300 block of Second Avenue with hanging baskets, patio tables and umbrellas out front under mature trees", "(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 1440px) 40vw, 545px", "display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(240px,29vw,420px);object-fit:cover;object-position:center 58%", true %}
<figcaption class="n-cap">Second Avenue, the 300 block</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</div>
</section>

{#- 2. Quick access -#}
<section class="n-bg-white n-home-quick" aria-labelledby="quick-h">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-top:clamp(28px,4vw,60px)">
<h2 class="n-label n-label--quiet" id="quick-h" style="margin:0 0 12px">Go straight to</h2>
<div class="n-rail n-rail--light" style="margin-bottom:4px"></div>
<div class="n-quick">
{%- for q in quick %}
<a class="n-shift" href="{{ q.href }}" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:14px;align-items:baseline;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--n-rule);text-decoration:none">
<span>
<span style="display:block;font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.3;color:var(--n-evergreen)">{{ q.label }}</span>
<span class="n-small" style="display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:.875rem">{{ q.note }}</span>
</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" style="color:var(--n-red);font-size:1.125rem">&#8594;</span>
</a>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
</div>
</section>

{#- 3. Civic notice — compact on purpose: visible without dominating. -#}
<section class="n-bg-sky n-home-notice" aria-labelledby="notice-h" style="margin-top:clamp(32px,4.5vw,72px);border-top:1px solid var(--n-sky);border-bottom:1px solid var(--n-sky)">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-block:clamp(24px,3vw,40px)">
<div class="n-g2-wide" style="align-items:center;gap:clamp(16px,2vw,44px)">
<div>
<h2 class="n-label" id="notice-h" style="color:var(--n-sky-ink);margin:0">Niwot incorporation election</h2>
<div style="font-family:var(--n-serif);font-size:clamp(1.5rem,1.2rem + 1vw,2.125rem);line-height:1.1;color:var(--n-evergreen);margin-top:8px">November 3, 2026</div>
</div>
<div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:0;max-width:58ch">Review what is on the ballot, who may vote and official election resources.</p>
<a class="n-link" href="/civic/incorporation-election/" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:14px">View the neutral ballot guide <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

{#- 4. Upcoming events: the next three, each opening its own day on the calendar. -#}
<section class="n-bg-white n-pad n-home-events" aria-labelledby="ev-h">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-shead n-shead-row">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Upcoming events</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="ev-h" style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--n-evergreen)">What&#8217;s happening</h2>
</div>
<a class="n-link" href="/events/">Full events calendar <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
</div>
{#- Rendered at build time; refreshed from the real date on load. -#}
<div class="n-g3" style="margin-top:clamp(24px,3vw,44px)" data-upcoming="link">{{ eventsBuild.upcomingHomeHtml | safe }}</div>
</div>
</section>

{#- 5. Explore photo grid — four different crops, every link worded. -#}
<section class="n-bg-paper n-pad n-home-explore" aria-labelledby="exp-h">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-shead n-shead-row">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Where to go</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="exp-h" style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Start on Second Avenue</h2>
</div>
<span class="n-small" style="max-width:44ch;color:var(--n-ink)">Park once. The two commercial blocks are a fifteen-minute walk apart; the park and the trail are at their edges.</span>
</div>
<div class="n-exp" style="margin-top:clamp(24px,3vw,44px)">
<article class="n-exp-wide">
<a href="/explore/#oldtown" style="display:block;text-decoration:none">
{% photo "niwot-tribune-storefront.jpg", "The Niwot Tribune false-front building on Second Avenue with a shingled porch roof, painted columns and a grand piano on the sidewalk", "(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 1440px) 62vw, 845px", "display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(260px,30vw,440px);object-fit:cover;object-position:center 52%" %}
<h3 class="n-h3" style="margin-top:16px;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Old Town</h3>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:8px 0 0;max-width:54ch;font-size:.9375rem">The brick commercial block on Second Avenue, walkable end to end in about ten minutes.</p>
<span class="n-link" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:12px">Explore Old Town <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></span>
</a>
</article>
<article>
<a href="/explore/#cottonwood" style="display:block;text-decoration:none">
{% photo "niwot-tavern-patios.jpg", "Umbrella-shaded patios outside the Niwot Tavern and Raza Fresa Mexican Kitchen with two bronze bear sculptures on the corner", "(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 1440px) 30vw, 410px", "display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(260px,30vw,440px);object-fit:cover;object-position:center 50%" %}
<h3 class="n-h3" style="margin-top:16px;font-size:1.375rem;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Cottonwood Square</h3>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">The second cluster of shops, kitchens and everyday services.</p>
<span class="n-link" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:12px">Visit the Square <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></span>
</a>
</article>
<article>
<a href="/explore/#outdoors" style="display:block;text-decoration:none">
{% photo "front-range-sunset-trail.jpg", "Sunset over the Front Range from a dirt trail on the grassland edge of Niwot", "(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 1440px) 30vw, 410px", "display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(220px,23vw,330px);object-fit:cover;object-position:center 62%" %}
<h3 class="n-h3" style="margin-top:16px;font-size:1.375rem;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Parks &amp; Trails</h3>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">Whistle Stop Park, the LoBo Regional Trail, and the fields east of the blocks.</p>
<span class="n-link" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:12px">Find the trails <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></span>
</a>
</article>
<article class="n-exp-wide">
<a href="/explore/#art" style="display:block;text-decoration:none">
{% photo "niwot-gateway-sculpture.jpg", "The Vintage Colorado Niwot gateway sculpture, a steel arch over an oval sign, with the Flatirons behind it", "(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 1440px) 62vw, 845px", "display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(220px,23vw,330px);object-fit:cover;object-position:center 62%" %}
<h3 class="n-h3" style="margin-top:16px;font-size:1.375rem;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Public Art</h3>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:8px 0 0;max-width:54ch;font-size:.9375rem">The steel gateway sculpture at the highway edge, the Niwot Sculpture Park, and works sited around the commercial blocks.</p>
<span class="n-link" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:12px">See the public art <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></span>
</a>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>

{#- 6. Eat & shop -#}
<section class="n-bg-white n-pad n-home-shop" aria-labelledby="shop-h">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-g2-wide">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Eat &amp; shop locally</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="shop-h" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:20ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Independent, and mostly family-run.</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:18px 0 0;max-width:52ch">Kitchens, grocers, makers and services across Old Town and Cottonwood Square, with the Business Association directory for current hours.</p>
<div class="n-btns" style="margin-top:24px">
<a class="n-btn" href="/eat-shop/">Open the directory</a>
<a class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" href="/plan-a-visit/#contact">Add a listing</a>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="n-label n-label--quiet">Browse by category</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:0 clamp(16px,2vw,36px);margin-top:10px">
{#- The same categories the directory renders, counted from the same data,
    so the two pages cannot drift apart. -#}
{%- for c in listings.categories %}{% if c.slug != 'all' %}
<a class="n-shift n-shift--sm" href="/eat-shop/?category={{ c.slug }}" style="display:block;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--n-rule);font-size:1rem;text-decoration:none">{{ c.label }} <span style="color:var(--n-muted)">{{ c.count }}</span></a>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

{#- 7. Community and resident resources, one block. -#}
<section class="n-bg-sage n-pad n-home-community" aria-labelledby="comm-h" style="border-top:1px solid var(--n-sage);border-bottom:1px solid var(--n-sage)">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-shead n-shead-row">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Community</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="comm-h" style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--n-evergreen)">The people who run it</h2>
</div>
<a class="n-link" href="/community/">All organizations <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
</div>
<div class="n-g2" style="margin-top:clamp(24px,3vw,44px)">
<div>
<h3 class="n-h3" style="font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Community organizations</h3>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:12px 0 0;max-width:52ch;font-size:.9375rem">With no town government, most of what happens in Niwot is organized by residents through local groups.</p>
<div style="margin-top:18px">
{%- for o in organizations %}
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:14px;align-items:baseline;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(36,72,58,.25)">
<span style="font-size:1rem">{{ o.name }}</span>
<a class="n-link" href="{{ o.href }}" rel="noopener" style="font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap">{{ o.linkLabel }}</a>
</div>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="n-h3" style="font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Resident resources</h3>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:12px 0 0;max-width:52ch;font-size:.9375rem">Niwot is unincorporated, so services come from Boulder County and a set of special districts.</p>
<div style="margin-top:18px">
{%- for r in resources %}
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:14px;align-items:baseline;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(36,72,58,.25)">
<span style="font-size:1rem">{{ r.what }}</span>
<a class="n-link" href="{{ r.href }}" rel="noopener" style="font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap">{{ r.who }}</a>
</div>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
<a class="n-link" href="/community/#resources" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:16px">All resident resources, including roads, sewer and elections <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

{#- 8. Niwot history, in brief. The full story has its own page. -#}
<section class="n-bg-paper n-pad n-home-history" aria-labelledby="hist-h">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-shead n-shead-row">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Niwot history</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="hist-h" style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--n-evergreen)">The railroad shaped the Niwot we know.</h2>
</div>
<a class="n-link" href="/our-story/">Read our story <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
</div>
<div class="n-g3" style="margin-top:clamp(22px,2.6vw,36px)">
{%- for f in facts %}
<div style="padding-top:14px;border-top:2px solid var(--n-evergreen)">
<div class="n-label">{{ f.label }}</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">{{ f.text }}</p>
</div>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
</div>
</section>

{#- 9. Newsletter + contribute -#}
<section class="n-bg-green n-pad n-home-contact" aria-labelledby="nl-h">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-g2">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Community updates</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="nl-h" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:22ch">Notices by email</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:16px 0 0;max-width:52ch;color:var(--n-paper)">An occasional message when something here changes: a new event, a confirmed listing, a corrected fact. Never on a schedule, never advertising.</p>
<form data-contact-form method="post" action="/api/contact" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:22px;max-width:520px">
<input type="hidden" name="kind" value="newsletter">
<span class="n-sr" aria-hidden="true"><label for="nl-company">Leave this field empty</label><input id="nl-company" name="company" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></span>
<label class="n-sr" for="nl-email">Your email address</label>
<input id="nl-email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" placeholder="you@example.com" style="flex:1 1 220px;min-width:0;padding:14px;background:var(--n-white);border:2px solid var(--n-white);font:inherit;font-size:1rem;color:var(--n-ink)">
<button class="n-btn" type="submit" style="cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit">Subscribe</button>
</form>
<template data-form-success><p role="status" style="margin:22px 0 0;padding-top:14px;border-top:3px solid var(--n-gold-lt);max-width:48ch;color:var(--n-white)">Thank you &#8212; your address has been received.</p></template>
<template data-form-unavailable><p role="status" data-message style="margin:22px 0 0;padding-top:14px;border-top:3px solid var(--n-gold-lt);max-width:48ch;color:var(--n-white)">Email notices are not running yet, so nothing was sent. The <a href="/events/">events calendar</a> carries the same updates in the meantime.</p></template>
<p class="n-small" style="margin:12px 0 0;max-width:48ch;color:var(--n-sage-lt)">Your address is used only for these notices, and every notice says how to unsubscribe. No advertising and no third-party tracking. <a href="/privacy/">How your address is handled</a>.</p>
</div>
<div>
<div class="n-label">Contribute</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:22ch">Add a listing or a correction</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:16px 0 0;max-width:52ch;color:var(--n-paper)">Business owners, event organizers and residents keep this guide accurate. Send a listing, a date or a correction with its source.</p>
<div class="n-btns" style="margin-top:24px">
<a class="n-btn" href="/plan-a-visit/#contact">Send a submission</a>
<a class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" href="/plan-a-visit/">Plan a visit</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
